# Terraform (Sportcast pattern)

- Roots live at `infra/projects/<group>/<env>/`.
- Plumbing files are `_providers.tf` and `_data.tf`. Module plumbing is `main.tf`, `_variables.tf`, `_outputs.tf`.
- `main.tf` holds only `locals` and `module.app_group`.
- One resource family per file (`postgres-*.tf`, `log-analytics.tf`, `app-*.tf`).
- Tags always include `environment`, `owner`, `project`. Pass `local.common_tags`.
- Postgres names: `psql-${local.resource_suffix}-<purpose>`. Store admin secrets in Key Vault. Use `lifecycle.ignore_changes` on `zone` and `storage_mb`.
- Run `terraform fmt -recursive infra` before commit (2-space indent, aligned `=`).
- Do not copy Sportcast ADO git module URLs, tenant IDs, or VPN IPs.
- Data-source context uses `/** ... */` block comments.

```hcl
# BAD — generic env folder and a postgres module
# infra/envs/dre-dev/main.tf → module "postgres"

# GOOD
# infra/projects/betterme/dev/main.tf          locals + app_group
# infra/projects/betterme/dev/postgres-core.tf inline Flexible Server
```
